    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wujing was originally a great general of the Heavenly Roller Shutter, but was demoted to the Liusha River due to accidentally breaking a glass cup. Every seven days, he would suffer the pain of ten thousand swords piercing through his heart. As time goes by, Wujing's inner self gradually darkens. He no longer silently endures pain, but seeks to explore the truth behind the workings of this world in order to redeem himself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/9b00eec122899f43c76f63d0a637d11f.poster.avif?t=1748163956\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/9b00eec122899f43c76f63d0a637d11f.webm?t=1748163956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/9b00eec122899f43c76f63d0a637d11f.mp4?t=1748163956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: Players decide their number of steps forward by rolling dice, and can spend money on building shops or other buildings in open spaces. In the store, players can purchase equipment to enhance their attributes, or purchase medicines to restore their unit status. When players encounter enemies, they will enter turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can also spend reputation points on the Spirit Platform to obtain spirit beasts to help them fight. They can also purchase skill scrolls in the skill store for spirit beasts to learn skills, or purchase cultivation pills in the Spirit Treasure store to enhance their spirit beast attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the player's funds are less than or equal to 0, the game fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wujing was originally a great general of the Heavenly Roller Shutter, but was demoted to the Liusha River due to accidentally breaking a glass cup. Every seven days, he would suffer the pain of ten thousand swords piercing through his heart. As time goes by, Wujing's inner self gradually darkens. He no longer silently endures pain, but seeks to explore the truth behind the workings of this world in order to redeem himself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/9b00eec122899f43c76f63d0a637d11f.poster.avif?t=1748163956\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/9b00eec122899f43c76f63d0a637d11f.webm?t=1748163956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728380/extras/9b00eec122899f43c76f63d0a637d11f.mp4?t=1748163956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: Players decide their number of steps forward by rolling dice, and can spend money on building shops or other buildings in open spaces. In the store, players can purchase equipment to enhance their attributes, or purchase medicines to restore their unit status. When players encounter enemies, they will enter turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can also spend reputation points on the Spirit Platform to obtain spirit beasts to help them fight. They can also purchase skill scrolls in the skill store for spirit beasts to learn skills, or purchase cultivation pills in the Spirit Treasure store to enhance their spirit beast attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the player's funds are less than or equal to 0, the game fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
